  - m_Id: 1792996101054476
    m_Localized: Mood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054477
    m_Localized: Affection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054478
    m_Localized: Affection Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054479
    m_Localized: Raise {CharacterName}'s {PropName} to {Value} ({Progress})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3166046073766805607
  - m_Id: 1792996101054480
    m_Localized: Arrival in Town
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054481
    m_Localized: 'Your first days in town: get your bearings and meet a few people
      along the way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054482
    m_Localized: Neighborly Ties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054483
    m_Localized: Friendships grow by showing up. Bring a small gift, share some small
      talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054484
    m_Localized: Trying Your Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054485
    m_Localized: "The town is full of little diversions. Try a few \u2014 win or
      lose, it all counts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054486
    m_Localized: Errands and Errand-Runs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054487
    m_Localized: Someone has to do the shopping, and someone has to do the walking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054488
    m_Localized: Days Go On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1792996101054489
    m_Localized: One task after another, and the days keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
